{
  "label": "Quick Start",
  "category": "Scenario Studio",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Quick Start",
      "id": "quick-start",
      "intro": "Buat rule deteksi fraud pertama dalam 5 langkah cepat. Perkiraan waktu: 10 menit.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Buka Scenario Management",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Klik menu **Scenario Management** di sidebar kiri\n\u2022 Lihat daftar rule yang sudah ada beserta statusnya\n\u2022 Klik **+ Add New** di pojok kanan atas",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#3b82f6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z\"/><polyline points=\"9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22\"/></svg></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Scenario Management</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b\">Daftar rule dengan status</div></div><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#3b82f6;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add New</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#fef2f2;font-size:6px;color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;\">Draft</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#fffbeb;font-size:6px;color:#d97706;font-weight:600;\">Submitted</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f0fdf4;font-size:6px;color:#16a34a;font-weight:600;\">Approved</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:6px;color:#2563eb;font-weight:600;\">Active</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Pilih Tipe Rule",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **GENERAL** \u2014 3 langkah, untuk aturan sederhana\n\u2022 **CONDITION** \u2014 4 langkah, untuk aturan kompleks\n\u2022 Pilih GENERAL dulu untuk belajar",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;padding:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:2px solid #f59e0b;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffbeb,#fff);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-align:center;\">GENERAL</div><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#475569;text-align:center;\">3 langkah<span style=\"display:block;font-size:6px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px;\">Sederhana & Cepat</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;overflow:hidden;opacity:.65;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;background:#e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center;\">CONDITION</div><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center;\">4 langkah<span style=\"display:block;font-size:6px;color:#cbd5e1;margin-top:2px;\">Kompleks & Detail</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Isi Parameter Rule",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Rule Name** \u2014 Nama rule (contoh: Deteksi Transfer Besar)\n\u2022 **Risk Score** \u2014 Nilai 0-100, makin tinggi makin berisiko\n\u2022 **Priority** \u2014 HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n\u2022 **Active Period** \u2014 Jadwal aktif rule\n\u2022 Klik **Continue** untuk lanjut",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 15V3m0 12l-4-4m4 4l4-4M2 17l.621 2.485A2 2 0 004.561 21h14.878a2 2 0 001.94-1.515L22 17\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Configure Parameters</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;color:#64748b;\">Rule Name</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Deteksi Transfer Besar</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;color:#64748b;\">Risk Score</div><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;\">75</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Buat Flow Deteksi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Drag** node kondisi dari sidebar kiri ke canvas\n\u2022 Atur parameter tiap node (field, operator, value)\n\u2022 **Hubungkan** node via handle (lingkaran) output \u2192 input\n\u2022 Klik **Auto-arrange** untuk merapikan layout",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">AMOUNT > 10jt</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #6366f1;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">AND</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #ef4444;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;\">ALERT</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Review & Submit",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Periksa ringkasan rule (nama, tipe, risk score, flow)\n\u2022 Klik **Submit Scenario** untuk menyimpan sebagai Draft\n\u2022 Rule siap di-review dan diaktivasi",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"width:4px;background:#14b8a6;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;flex:1;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Review & Submit</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdfa;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #99f6e4;\">Nama: Deteksi Transfer Besar</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdfa;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #99f6e4;\">Risk: 75</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
